In-Game Script by DillRellis

Intelligent Airlock Manager

Each airlock must be set up as follows:

One button panel with its Custom Data set to:
[Airlock]
id=*airlockID*

Internal airlock vents/lights/LCDs should have their Custom Data set to:
[AirlockC]
[*airlockID*]

Airlock doors/lights/sensor vents should have their Custom Data set to:
[AirlockA]
[*airlockID*]
OR
[AirlockB]
[*airlockID*]
